00:12:35,984 --> 00:12:41,114
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">That's so you. But I live
close by! And I'm strong anyway!</font>

163
00:12:42,574 --> 00:12:43,909
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Let's gooooo.</font>

164
00:12:48,538 --> 00:12:52,667
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I wonder... Right now... What's
going through Chizu's mind...</font>

165
00:13:02,219 --> 00:13:03,136
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Later.</font>

166
00:13:03,220 --> 00:13:04,346
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Shota.</font>

167
00:13:04,429 --> 00:13:09,059
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Thanks for that. If I'd been the
one to say something back there...</font>

168
00:13:11,770 --> 00:13:17,234
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Chizuru would've been upset if she
thought I was tiptoeing around her.</font>

169
00:13:17,818 --> 00:13:22,489
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">If she got mad at me fine... but
she would've just been hurt.</font>

170
00:13:26,952 --> 00:13:31,915
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">No matter what happens, you're always
worrying about Yoshida before yourself,</font>

171
00:13:31,998 --> 00:13:35,460
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">aren't you? It isn't your fault bud,
so don't let it get to you so much.</font>

172
00:13:35,544 --> 00:13:39,005
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I'm not really upset or anything, but...</font>

173
00:13:45,512 --> 00:13:47,097
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">But, I don't know.</font>

174
00:13:47,180 --> 00:13:51,101
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I'm... not sure what I felt
in that situation was worry.</font>

175
00:13:52,644 --> 00:13:54,479
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I still think it was.</font>

176
00:13:56,773 --> 00:14:00,151
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">He must really like Yoshida. A whole lot.</font>

177
00:14:04,865 --> 00:14:06,199
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">There!</font>

178
00:14:08,827 --> 00:14:12,664
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- Awesome! Looks like I take the win again!
- We've been playing</font>

179
00:14:12,747 --> 00:14:15,417
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">cards for 4 hours straight...</font>

180
00:14:15,500 --> 00:14:18,169
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">So, what'll we do next?</font>

181
00:14:19,087 --> 00:14:20,505
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Chi... Uh I~uh...</font>

182
00:14:21,715 --> 00:14:22,632
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Hey.</font>

183
00:14:23,717 --> 00:14:26,803
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Are... Aaare you okay?</font>

184
00:14:30,974 --> 00:14:33,643
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Ah. You mean about Toru.</font>

185
00:14:36,104 --> 00:14:41,026
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Oh, that's right. I haven't
congratulated him yet. I totally forgot.</font>

186
00:14:43,486 --> 00:14:46,197
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Maybe I'll go and visit him tomorrow.</font>

187
00:14:47,824 --> 00:14:51,077
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Afterall, the "big brother" I've always
looked up to's finally getting married!</font>

188
00:14:51,161 --> 00:14:54,456
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">That's right!</font>

189
00:14:55,290 --> 00:14:58,460
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">And you're totally
gonna find someone better!</font>

190
00:14:59,127 --> 00:15:01,504
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">... Crap!</font>

191
00:15:02,964 --> 00:15:09,095
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Yeah, that's true. But anyway, sorry
we had to leave Ryu's place so early.</font>

192
00:15:09,179 --> 00:15:12,849
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">It was supposed to be
Yano-chin's consolation party.</font>

193
00:15:12,933 --> 00:15:17,771
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Don't even worry about that~ I
totally forgot about it, Chizu.</font>

194
00:15:17,854 --> 00:15:22,734
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Woah, when did it get so
late? Should we get to bed then?</font>

195
00:15:36,623 --> 00:15:40,460
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I've had this little
crush for a super long time!</font>

196
00:15:40,543 --> 00:15:44,422
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I am still a kid afterall so
there's no way I'm even on his radar.</font>

197
00:15:44,506 --> 00:15:48,426
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">That's why I've decided I'm
gonna become a real catch!</font>

198
00:15:50,428 --> 00:15:53,556
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Once I grow up, you never know, right?</font>

199
00:15:53,640 --> 00:15:57,894
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">See, the person I like
is his older brother.</font>

200
00:16:16,454 --> 00:16:19,040
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Chizu is already up and about.</font>

201
00:16:29,509 --> 00:16:33,513
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Did I wake you?</font>

202
00:16:35,724 --> 00:16:38,018
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I'm gonna wear a miniskirt!</font>

203
00:16:38,768 --> 00:16:42,355
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Maybe it's not that
she woke up super early.</font>

204
00:16:43,606 --> 00:16:46,901
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Maybe it's that she wasn't able to sleep.</font>

205
00:16:46,985 --> 00:16:49,154
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Isn't this sweatshirt awesome?</font>

206
00:16:49,237 --> 00:16:51,656
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">It's a hand-me-down from my brother, and
there's a little hole around here, but</font>

207
00:16:51,740 --> 00:16:54,534
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">it's really comfy.</font>

208
00:16:54,617 --> 00:16:58,413
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Uh...</font>

209
00:17:08,548 --> 00:17:11,051
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Bye! See you guys at school!</font>

210
00:17:23,271 --> 00:17:27,817
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I figured that she'd kick and scream and
start bawling like she usually does. Let</font>

211
00:17:27,901 --> 00:17:32,447
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">it all out, you know? So at first, I
honestly couldn't tell what was going on</font>

212
00:17:32,530 --> 00:17:37,118
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">with her~ like if she was
angry or hurt, or what.</font>

213
00:17:41,498 --> 00:17:44,667
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Is there something we can do for her?</font>

214
00:17:45,627 --> 00:17:49,422
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Right now... I don't think
we can do anything really.</font>

215
00:17:49,506 --> 00:17:51,341
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">We can't even talk to her.</font>

216
00:17:51,883 --> 00:17:56,513
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I mean, we could try, but with
the emotional state she's... uh...</font>

217
00:17:57,263 --> 00:18:03,353
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">She was so happy talking about
how she was gonna wear a miniskirt.</font>

218
00:18:07,816 --> 00:18:12,487
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I couldn't comfort her or cheer
her up. I couldn't do anything.</font>

219
00:18:13,863 --> 00:18:20,787
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I couldn't find a single good thing
to say that would help her... Nothing...</font>

220
00:18:29,921 --> 00:18:31,673
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I'm the same. So, yeah.</font>

221
00:18:33,424 --> 00:18:37,679
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I couldn't find the words
either when it mattered the most.</font>

222
00:18:41,641 --> 00:18:46,312
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">What are friends... supposed to
do in situations like these?</font>

223
00:18:49,315 --> 00:18:51,776
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">{\an8}SANADA</font>

224
00:18:55,780 --> 00:18:58,867
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Pops is laughing his head off in there.</font>

225
00:19:03,288 --> 00:19:06,749
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I'm like their daughter, but I'm not
actually their daughter. Like his little</font>

226
00:19:06,833 --> 00:19:10,295
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">sister, but not
actually his little sister.</font>

227
00:19:10,378 --> 00:19:12,797
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">In the end, we're not related.</font>

228
00:19:13,590 --> 00:19:16,718
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">This is important quality time they're
spending as a family. What business does</font>

229
00:19:16,801 --> 00:19:19,971
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">some neighborhood kid have butting in?</font>

230
00:19:22,182 --> 00:19:24,350
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">A neighborhood kid, huh...</font>

231
00:19:31,316 --> 00:19:36,154
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">{\an8}Ryuuuuu, let's have a real battle and if
you don't fight me seriously, then I'm</font>

232
00:19:36,237 --> 00:19:41,367
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">{\an8}gonna kill you dead! Owwie!
My head! That really hurt me!</font>

233
00:19:41,451 --> 00:19:44,662
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Ryu! It's not good to make a girl cry!</font>

234
00:19:49,918 --> 00:19:53,296
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">{\an8}Well now you're feeling
all better aren't you?</font>

235
00:19:55,673 --> 00:20:01,638
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Toru! I caught a cool
bug! Look, look, look!</font>

236
00:20:01,721 --> 00:20:03,473
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Toru! A bug!</font>

237
00:20:04,432 --> 00:20:06,392
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Toru! Loooook!</font>

238
00:20:10,521 --> 00:20:15,693
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Why bugs? I have no clue why I
showed affection like that as a kid.</font>

239
00:20:16,736 --> 00:20:17,737
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Still...</font>

240
00:20:17,820 --> 00:20:20,698
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Cool Chii!</font>

241
00:20:22,992 --> 00:20:25,578
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Toru would always smile at me.</font>

242
00:20:28,414 --> 00:20:31,960
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">He was rarely alone. There was always a
girlfriend around. But none of them seemed</font>

243
00:20:32,043 --> 00:20:35,546
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">to stick around for all that long.</font>

244
00:20:35,630 --> 00:20:40,009
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">So, when he dated someone,
I never thought much of it.</font>

245
00:20:40,093 --> 00:20:45,473
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">That's why I held on to my dream
for so long... to marry Toru one day.</font>

246
00:21:02,240 --> 00:21:05,868
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I guess the one who
gets to fulfill my dream...</font>

247
00:21:08,621 --> 00:21:09,831
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Won't be me.</font>

248
00:22:27,033 --> 00:22:29,911
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Feelings that don't get through.</font>

249
00:22:29,994 --> 00:22:31,746
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Tears that overflow.</font>

250
00:22:32,580 --> 00:22:34,457
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Next time: "Present"</font>
